WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.755
Production cleaning pipelines often need lineage
fields Source ID

00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:11.460
links the prepared row back to the raw record A rule
version identifies

00:00:11.486 --> 00:00:18.991
which logic was used A timestamp records when
cleaning occurred Issue

00:00:19.017 --> 00:00:24.980
codes explain detected problems Review status
records the resolution

00:00:25.006 --> 00:00:30.808
state These fields make the cleaning process
reproducible and auditable
